.TH HWIO-MONITOR 1 "" "HARDWARIO Monitor @HWIO_VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
hwio-monitor \- HARDWARIO Monitor, console, log and flashing tool for HARDWARIO devices
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hwio-monitor
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B hwio-monitor
starts the HARDWARIO Monitor desktop application: device console and logs, application and
modem firmware flashing and connection diagnostics for HARDWARIO devices such as CHESTER,
through a SEGGER J-Link probe or Bluetooth. A second start brings the running window to the
front.
.PP
SEGGER J-Link Software 8.00 or newer must be installed separately.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hwio (1),
https://github.com/hardwario/hio-monitor
